":196,"_13":197,"_28":198,"_182":199,"_184":200,"_186":194},{"_178":190,"_13":191,"_28":192,"_182":193,"_184":21,"_186":194},{"_178":179,"_13":180,"_28":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187},"id","ffenz5je0x7wrx3q2albdol0q","Check Point 多款产品存在权限提升与安全策略绕过漏洞","Check Point 多款安全产品存在可导致权限提升和安全策略绕过的漏洞，涉及 CVE-2026-107484、CVE-2026-120490、CVE-2026-123039。","source",{"_56":188,"_189":187},"publishedAt","2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","selected",false,"CERT-FR","firstParty","w32prfcxar9lgnbdhmsb4fb62","攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 漏洞破坏 Check Point 网关并部署擦除程序","攻击者已利用 PHP2Shell 漏洞入侵 Check Point 网关并部署擦除程序。第一波攻击于 10 月 30 日启动并针对以色列组织，第二波于 11 月 2 日启动并波及多个国家组织的 Check Point Security Gateways。",{"_56":195,"_189":187},true,"SecurityWeek","qjrrre5p1072uci857wf0xu5x","攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 漏洞入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 TSGA 后门擦除 ESXi 文件","未知攻击者利用 Check Point Security Gateways 的 PHP2Shell 漏洞取得初始访问，再利用 Gaia OS 提权漏洞 CVE-2026-123039 植入 TSGA、TSProxy 和 PHP web shell，并横向至 VMware ESXi 擦除文件。",{"_56":201,"_189":187},"2026-11-13T08:05:49.000Z","The Hacker News","h9lynekay3g8pb2185is1c37g","攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-109618 和 CVE-2026-109619 入侵 Check Point Security Gateway 的 Mobile Access 门户。",{"_56":205,"_189":187},"BleepingComputer","mwouaoheoihzxg7tv9qiyhivi","CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","CISA 将 UnrealIRCd 命令注入漏洞 CVE-2026-114713 和 Check Point 本地提权漏洞 CVE-2026-123039 加入 KEV 目录，确认均已被真实利用，并要求联邦机构在 2026 年 11 月 16 日前完成处置。",{"_56":211,"_189":187},"2026-11-14T09:08:00.000Z","Security Affairs",{"_213":214,"_13":215,"_20":21,"_17":109,"_216":217},"factId","fzelEpTZdDpQ","攻击者利用PHP2Shell攻击网关","representative",{"_178":202,"_13":31,"_28":203,"_182":218,"_184":23,"_186":194},{"_56":205,"_189":187},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",4,{"_227":228,"_229":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
